# Kairo run worker — orchestrates OpenCode inside user sandboxes.
# Shared keys (DATABASE_URL, TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY, GITHUB_API_URL,
# REDIS_URL, SANDBOX_SECRET, LLM_PROXY_BASE_URL, OPENCODE_MODEL) fall back to
# apps/api/.env when not set here — copy only what you want to override.

# REDIS_URL=redis://127.0.0.1:6379
# SANDBOX_SECRET=replace-with-long-sandbox-secret
# LLM_PROXY_BASE_URL=http://host.docker.internal:4100
# OPENCODE_MODEL=nvidia/nemotron-3.5-super-vl:free
# OPENCODE_PROVIDER_ID=kairo
# RUN_TIMEOUT_MS=600000
